# Qualcomm SM8450 (waipio). Architecture settings (4 KiB stage 1, PAC, PAN,
# arch timer, ArmDTPlatform) come from profiles/arch/arm64e.
#
# No SoC-specific kernel option is required for stage 0. The Adreno 730 GPU is
# described in dts/sm8450.dtsi but has no UniXNU component yet, so
# CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_ADRENO must stay unset until an Adreno730 + AdrenoMetal ABI
# port exists; enabling it would bind Adreno740 register layouts to a 730.
